summary.label:
It's time to get acquainted with a cool countdown timer that will remind you of important events and dates! 

Birthdays of friends and relatives, a month without sweets, training at a strictly allocated time, approaching New Year and Valentine's Day - now you will not forget anything, you will have time everywhere and prepare for important events in advance!

The app allows you to create a countdown clock that will show how much time in days, hours, minutes and seconds is left until the desired event. 

App Features:

- Create timers in unlimited quantities, of any duration, whether it's 9 months of pregnancy or 2 weeks before your long-awaited vacation;
- Pick up ready-made backgrounds, different colors, or place your own photos on the event screen;
- Place the widget anywhere on your Iphone home screen so you can count down important dates at all times;
- Receive notifications when an event is nearing completion by setting flexible settings;
- Set annual recurrences and more.
